        "RawResponse": "{\n  \"ExplainUserIntent\": \"Add the contents of the variable %goalsToCall% to the list stored in %goalsCouldBeCalled%\",\n  \"Reason\": \"The step involves manipulating list variables by appending one list to another, which matches the capabilities of the ListDictionaryModule that handles list and dictionary operations such as add, update, and merge.\",\n  \"StepDescription\": \"Take the list or collection stored in the variable %goalsToCall% and append all its elements to the existing list stored in %goalsCouldBeCalled%, effectively merging the two lists.\",\n  \"Modules\": [\"PLang.Modules.ListDictionaryModule\"],\n  \"StepName\": \"append_goals_to_call_to_goals_could_be_called\",\n  \"Confidence\": \"Very High\",\n  \"Inconsistency\": null\n}"
